  message: "PREMISE CHECK at the taint level (2026-11-03, dev 3b6463d531): verify-claims refines python external dsts before taint (refine_external_edges, WI-dilih), so the survey-level edge alone was not proof. Ran verify-claims on the fixture with an overlay declaring flask complete AND three candidate net_recv rows (module flask.request.args methods [get]; module flask.request methods [args.get]; module flask methods [request.args.get]) against claim untrusted-input-no-host-fs: 0 flows, verdict inconclusive, held only by the WI-fuzik disclosure naming save. So no row shape reaches the call: the receiver is lost before taint, not merely in the survey. Artifacts: <scratch>/ritog/flask_request_source.yaml, flask_vc.json (session scratchpad; the command line is in ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/ritog_11032026/REACH.md's follow-up)."  # 8f3c
